    <!-- Volunteer Panel -->
    <div class="donate-panel" id="donate-volunteer" role="tabpanel">
      <p class="donate-panel-desc">Your time and skills are the most valuable contribution. Join a growing community of passionate animal rescuers across India.</p>
      <div class="volunteer-roles-grid">
        <div class="vol-role-card"><div class="vol-role-icon">🏠</div><h5>Foster a Rescued Animal</h5><p>Temporarily house a rescued animal until it finds a permanent home. Training & support provided by NGOs.</p></div>
        <div class="vol-role-card"><div class="vol-role-icon">🍖</div><h5>Join Feeding Drives</h5><p>Participate in weekend colony feeding programmes. Feed 50–200 street animals with fellow volunteers.</p></div>
        <div class="vol-role-card"><div class="vol-role-icon">📢</div><h5>Awareness & Social Media</h5><p>Share rescue stories, create content, run fundraising campaigns and educate your community.</p></div>
        <div class="vol-role-card"><div class="vol-role-icon">🩺</div><h5>Medical Support (Vets/Students)</h5><p>Assist in treatment camps, sterilization drives, and first-aid workshops for vet students and professionals.</p></div>
        <div class="vol-role-card"><div class="vol-role-icon">🚗</div><h5>Transport & Rescue Runs</h5><p>Use your vehicle to transport injured animals to clinics or shelters. Even 1 hour a week makes a difference.</p></div>
        <div class="vol-role-card"><div class="vol-role-icon">💻</div><h5>Tech & Creative Skills</h5><p>Help build websites, apps or design materials for NGOs that desperately need digital support.</p></div>
